{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣天后蔡依林出道27年魅力不減，近期不僅宣布將於明年1月重返台北大巨蛋，一連舉辦6場世界巡迴演唱會，私下愛狗成癡的她，也傳出迎來從韓國引進的新愛犬「哈妮」，事業與生活雙雙傳出好消息。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;蔡依林</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T05:43:58.134177+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T05:12:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T05:37:16.391363+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T05:37:16.391363+00:00","content_hash":"f05c27358f663f0270c12ed1d6ae3f5027eadf3f670a48649f9be63d49d1e6e2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}